## Overview

Links by heading id: [the request options](#requestoptions), [the token limit](#maxtokens), [errors](#errors-retries), [the release](#200-2026-10-15), [the German notes](#hinweise-für-straße), [launch](#-launch), [the second example](#example-1) and [the setup](#install).

## request_options

Underscores are dropped: the id is `requestoptions`, where GitHub's is `request_options`.

