## Errors & retries

The ampersand goes and the two spaces around it become one hyphen.

## 2.0.0 — 2026-10-15

A changelog-style heading: the dots and the dash go.

## Hinweise für Straße

Letters of every script stay.

## 🚀 Launch

The emoji goes after the text is trimmed, so the id starts with a hyphen.

